   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## sam3-segment.json\n\nSAM 3 text-prompted mask\n\nU6 - SAM 3 text-prompted segmentation (ComfyUI CORE, no custom pack). Describe the object in CLIPTextEncode -> SAM3_Detect returns the mask. Loaded via CheckpointLoaderSimple('sam3.1_multiplex_fp16.safetensors', 1.63 GB, Apache-2.0 repack by Comfy-Org). Verified on a 2-subject scene: 'the knight in silver armor' -> mask centroid x=0.26 with 0.0% in the right half; 'the woman in blue robes' -> centroid x=0.77 with 0.0% in the left half. ZERO cross-bleed, outline-accurate. This is the auto-masking that E8/E10 had to build by hand, and it is prompt-controllable where BiRefNet is class-agnostic and SAM1 needs manual points. refine_iterations=2 and threshold=0.5 are the knobs; bboxes/positive_coords/negative_coords inputs allow hybrid point+text prompting.\n\n---\n*How to run it: story **S3** in `HOWTO.md`  \u00b7  Why it is this way: **U6a** in the scenarios' `EXPERIMENTS` logs.*"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## sam3-segment.json\n\nSAM 3 text-prompted mask\n\nU6 - SAM 3 text-prompted segmentation (ComfyUI CORE, no custom pack). Describe the object in CLIPTextEncode -> SAM3_Detect returns the mask. Loaded via CheckpointLoaderSimple('sam3.1_multiplex_fp16.safetensors', 1.63 GB, Apache-2.0 repack by Comfy-Org). Verified on a 2-subject scene: 'the knight in silver armor' -> mask centroid x=0.26 with 0.0% in the right half; 'the woman in blue robes' -> centroid x=0.77 with 0.0% in the left half. ZERO cross-bleed, outline-accurate. This is the auto-masking that E8/E10 had to build by hand, and it is prompt-controllable where BiRefNet is class-agnostic and SAM1 needs manual points. refine_iterations=2 and threshold=0.5 are the knobs; bboxes/positive_coords/negative_coords inputs allow hybrid point+text prompting.\n\n---\n*How to run it: story **S3** in `HOWTO.md`  \u00b7  Why it is this way: **U6a** in the scenarios' `EXPERIMENTS` logs.*"
   },
